' Expect: 15
' Target: actba64
#console

' Declare の整数の仮引数へ Double / Single の式を渡すと整数へ変換する（切り捨て）。
Declare Function MulDiv Lib "kernel32" (a As Long, b As Long, c As Long) As Long
Dim X As Double, s As Single
Dim ok As Long
X = 1.5
If MulDiv(X * 5 + 200, 1, 1) = 207 Then ok = ok + 1
If MulDiv(X, 2, 1) = 2 Then ok = ok + 2
s = 3.75
If MulDiv(s, 1, 1) = 3 Then ok = ok + 4
If MulDiv(10, X * 4, 3) = 20 Then ok = ok + 8
ExitProcess(ok)
